Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung ano kasi the demand is great?

1984
01:51:47,420 --> 01:51:48,400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Talagang tumakbo.

1985
01:51:48,540 --> 01:52:03,920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maski hindi naman po kinakailangan, wala pong iniwan. Parang po karne ng manok, karne ng baboy. May African swine fever isang lugar pero kailangan mo magdala doon dahil walang supply ng baboy so tataas ang baboy when in fact it's not supposed to.

1986
01:52:03,920 --> 01:52:13,940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or isang lugar na galunggong is so mura dahil walang supply ng galunggong pero may dumating na galunggong so tataas yung presyo because the demand is great.

1987
01:52:13,940 --> 01:52:31,980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung po yung sinasabi ko Chairperson Juan and Madam Secretary, we have to check itong WESM. So po pwede ho eh kung titignan ho natin, pag-aralan lang ho siguro ninyo, take time na pag-aralan ho itong po ang problema natin sa generation, hindi po sa distribution.

1988
01:52:31,980 --> 01:52:51,540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: It's not Meralco, it's not Samelco, it's not the cooperative but the generator yung nagpo-produce ng kuryente para for distribution. Doon po ang problema because sobrang sipa ng presyo kagaya po niyan, full siya but then again parang banker fuel ang presyo niya.

1989
01:52:51,540 --> 01:53:00,700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sa sabihin po, barko. Kailangan pumantay dahil doon sa fuel ng barko kaya sobrang taas. Masyado pong exorbitant.

1990
