1991
01:53:30,260 --> 01:53:47,960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How to bring our electricity rate down. Lahat naman po tayo kasi tayo po pinakamahal sa Southeast Asia. I mean meron naman pa lang, meron pong pamamaraan. I know there's a way. If we just look, we just do natin simulan sa power generation.

1992
