Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ayun pa.

3714
02:58:52,460 --> 02:58:55,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, bakit siyang contingency ang kanyang category?

3715
02:58:56,740 --> 02:58:57,740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Eh, hindi na?

3716
02:58:57,740 --> 02:58:58,400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi na siya contingency.

3717
02:58:58,400 --> 02:58:58,900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah, okay.

3718
