Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

3737
02:59:55,800 --> 02:59:56,100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

3738
02:59:56,100 --> 02:59:58,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And, yeah, alam ko mahal, no?

3739
02:59:58,900 --> 02:59:59,920
